hank  you all for coming thank you so much for  listening to this episode of philosophy  for our times this podcast was brought  to you by the Institute of Arts ideas it  was hosted by me and I Carrie and I  guess this week mark Leonard and George  Galloway as ever please do subscribe to  make sure you never miss an episode  tell anyone you know that might be  interested and of course tune in next  week for more debates and talks from the  world's leading thinkers on today's  biggest ideas for more debates talks and  interviews subscribe today to the  Institute of Arts and ideas at IAI TV  you
 

